• name the four **chambers** on a diagram drawn from the front, and the four great **vessels**;
• give the **nine-step route** from the body and back again, and say why the blood passes through the heart twice;
• explain why the **pulmonary artery** is an artery, and why the **left ventricle** wall is thickest;
• say what the **valves** and **coronary** vessels do, and name the **renal** and **hepatic** vessels;
• calculate a **cardiac output** and a percentage increase, and read a pulse trace.
